# Cargo's build directory. `Cargo.lock` IS committed: this crate grows binaries (the
# language server, the importers), and a pinned lock is what makes a CI `cargo test` and a
# local one the same run.
/target

# The full-IR scaffold for the writer-first conformance gate (tests/gen-ir-full.mjs).
# Generated, never committed: once the Rust parser lands the gate reads the fixture sources
# directly and this bridge disappears. `tests/conformance.rs` skips with instructions when
# it is absent.
/tests/ir-full/
